ground-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC Official Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.114%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;SSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;Online Form 2026 : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e When will the online application for \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u0026nbsp;Recruitment 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Start?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"\u003e The online application for this recruitment \u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ehas started on \u003cstrong\u003e24 April 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the last date for online application for \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eOnline Form 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The last date for online application Form is \u003cstrong\u003e15 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e What is the age limit for \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBharti 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The age limit for \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Bharti 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;is as follows:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eThe \u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum age required is \u003cstrong\u003e18 Years \u0026amp; The Maximum Age Is 27 – 30 Years as on 01 August 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the eligibility for \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eVacancy 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eThe eligibility criteria for the \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC Stenographer Grade C, D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Vacancy 2026\u003c/strong\u003e are as follows on \u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC rules.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003c